msgid "The commit gate"
msgstr "O gate de commit"

#: ../../source/guides/devops/the-gate.rst:8
msgid "What runs at every commit, and why that set"
msgstr "O que roda a cada commit, e por que justamente esse conjunto"

#: ../../source/guides/devops/the-gate.rst:10
msgid "On a ``dev`` branch the hook runs ``make pre-commit``, an alias of ``make ci-fast``:"
msgstr "Num branch ``dev`` o hook roda ``make pre-commit``, um apelido de ``make ci-fast``:"

#: ../../source/guides/devops/the-gate.rst:17
msgid ""
"On a ``prod`` branch it runs ``make ci-full`` instead — everything gated, measured at"
" this commit. Same three layers, same report, same verdict; only the set of "
"measurements differs, and it differs by exactly the line drawn above."
msgstr ""
"Num branch ``prod`` ele roda ``make ci-full`` — tudo o que passa pelo gate, medido "
"neste commit. As mesmas três camadas, o mesmo relatório, o mesmo veredito; muda só o "
"conjunto de medições, e muda exatamente ao longo da linha traçada acima."

