msgstr "As três classes de branch"

#: ../../source/guides/devops/the-gate.rst:141
msgid ""
"``ci.yaml`` at the root of each repository puts every branch into one of three "
"classes:"
msgstr "O ``ci.yaml`` na raiz de cada repositório põe todo branch numa de três classes:"

